upgrades:
Traction without collaborators. Unofficial PayBox plugins stay private until each version is approved, so open the same 402 to every x402 client:
- a single-URL order form (/v1/orders/new?format=...&buyer=...&nonce=..., with terms derived deterministically from the URL);
- llms.txt and OpenAPI docs;
- a 'first 50 commissions, pay on delivery' launch thread on X;
